msgid ""
"Rules are evaluated in sequence; the first rule whose amount band matches "
"wins. Use min_amount=0 / max_amount=0 to match any amount. Approver groups "
"are signed in the listed order; any user in the current group can sign for "
"that step."
msgstr ""
